plus another one that is the matching between H and G2 of G1 of H,

01:14:37.075 --> 01:14:39.190
and Z and G1 of G2 of Z.

01:14:39.190 --> 01:14:39.790
Yes.

01:14:39.790 --> 01:14:41.800
Correct. So we have all these terms.

